@startuml
participant Producer
participant Evaluation
participant Control
participant Coordinator
Producer -> Evaluation: publish immutable reading
Evaluation -> Evaluation: capture profile; alert / cost
Evaluation -> Control: submit typed request
Control -> Control: CAS state; summary; output
Coordinator -> Producer: await completion / handle failure
Coordinator -> Control: close admission; drain; join
Coordinator -> Coordinator: report; archive; publish file
@enduml
